>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TabPFN 与表格基础模型：In-Context Learning 的零样本推断","id":"tabpfn-与表格基础模型-in-context-learning-的零样本推断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"元学习与 In-Context Learning 基础","id":"元学习与-in-context-learning-基础"},{"level":3,"text":"传统范式 vs 元学习范式","id":"传统范式-vs-元学习范式"},{"level":3,"text":"Prior-data Fitted Networks（PFN）","id":"prior-data-fitted-networks-pfn"},{"level":2,"text":"TabPFN 架构与工作原理","id":"tabpfn-架构与工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"TabPFN 的内部机制","id":"tabpfn-的内部机制"},{"level":3,"text":"TabPFN 的限制","id":"tabpfn-的限制"},{"level":2,"text":"AutoTabPFN 与大规模扩展","id":"autotabpfn-与大规模扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"表格基础模型的最新进展（2024-2026）","id":"表格基础模型的最新进展-2024-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"实用建议与使用场景","id":"实用建议与使用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"TabNet 与 FT-Transformer：基于注意力机制的表格深度学习","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/tabular-ml-gradient-boosting/deep-tabular/tabnet-ft-transformer"},"next":{"title":"深度模型 vs GBDT 选型：决策矩阵与实证分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/tabular-ml-gradient-boosting/deep-tabular/deep-vs-gbdt-when-to-use"}}